### COMP-006: Kubernetes Deployment Architecture

**Specification Reference:** REQ-008, REQ-010

**Task Service Deployment:**

```yaml
# k8s/deployments/task-service.yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: task-service
  namespace: default
spec:
  replicas: 2
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: task-service
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: task-service
      annotations:
        dapr.io/enabled: "true"
        dapr.io/app-id: "task-service"
        dapr.io/app-port: "8001"
        dapr.io/log-level: "info"
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: task-service
        image: ghcr.io/irfan/todoapp-task-service:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 8001
        env:
        - name: DATABASE_URL
          valueFrom:
            secretKeyRef:
              name: app-secrets
              key: database-url
        - name: DAPR_HTTP_PORT
          value: "3500"
        resources:
          requests:
            cpu: "100m"
            memory: "128Mi"
          limits:
            cpu: "500m"
            memory: "512Mi"
        livenessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /api/health
            port: 8001
          initialDelaySeconds: 10
          periodSeconds: 10
        readinessProbe:
          httpGet:
            path: /api/health
            port: 8001
          initialDelaySeconds: 5
          periodSeconds: 5
---
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: task-service
  namespace: default
spec:
  selector:
    app: task-service
  ports:
  - port: 8001
    targetPort: 8001
  type: ClusterIP
---
apiVersion: autoscaling/v2
kind: HorizontalPodAutoscaler
metadata:
  name: task-service-hpa
  namespace: default
spec:
  scaleTargetRef:
    apiVersion: apps/v1
    kind: Deployment
    name: task-service
  minReplicas: 2
  maxReplicas: 10
  metrics:
  - type: Resource
    resource:
      name: cpu
      target:
        type: Utilization
        averageUtilization: 70
```

**Similar deployments for:**
- Recurrence Service (port 8002)
- Reminder Service (port 8003)
- Chat Service (port 3002)
- MCP HTTP Server (port 3003)
- Next.js Frontend (port 3000)

