## Sequence Diagrams

### SEQ-001: Create Recurring Task Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant TaskSvc as Task Service
    participant RecurSvc as Recurrence Service
    participant Kafka
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    User->>Frontend: Create recurring task
    Frontend->>TaskSvc: POST /api/todos (with recurrence flag)
    TaskSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO todo
    TaskSvc->>RecurSvc: POST /api/recurrence/patterns
    RecurSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO recurrence_pattern
    RecurSvc->>Kafka: Publish task.created event
    RecurSvc-->>Frontend: 201 Created
    Frontend-->>User: Show success

    Note over RecurSvc: Dapr Cron triggers every minute
    RecurSvc->>DB: SELECT patterns due for spawning
    RecurSvc->>DB: INSERT new task instance
    RecurSvc->>DB: UPDATE recurrence_pattern (next_occurrence)
    RecurSvc->>Kafka: Publish task.spawned event
```

### SEQ-002: Set Due Date with Reminders

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant TaskSvc as Task Service
    participant ReminderSvc as Reminder Service
    participant Kafka
    participant DB

    User->>Frontend: Set due date + reminders
    Frontend->>TaskSvc: PUT /api/todos/{id}/due-date
    TaskSvc->>DB: UPDATE todo SET due_date
    TaskSvc->>ReminderSvc: POST /api/reminders/schedule
    ReminderSvc->>DB: INSERT INTO reminders (multiple rows)
    ReminderSvc-->>TaskSvc: Reminders scheduled
    TaskSvc->>Kafka: Publish task.due_date_set event
    TaskSvc-->>Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend-->>User: Show confirmation

    Note over ReminderSvc: Dapr Cron triggers every minute
    ReminderSvc->>DB: SELECT reminders WHERE trigger_at <= NOW()
    ReminderSvc->>Kafka: Publish reminder.triggered event
    ReminderSvc->>DB: UPDATE reminders SET sent_at
```

### SEQ-003: Search Tasks with Filters

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant TaskSvc as Task Service
    participant DB

    User->>Frontend: Enter search query + filters
    Frontend->>TaskSvc: GET /api/todos/search?q=...&priority=high&tags=work
    TaskSvc->>DB: SELECT with full-text search + filters
    Note over DB: Uses GIN index on search_vector
    DB-->>TaskSvc: Results with relevance scores
    TaskSvc-->>Frontend: JSON array of tasks
    Frontend-->>User: Display search results
```

### SEQ-004: Event-Driven Task Update Flow

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant TaskSvc as Task Service
    participant Kafka
    participant EventConsumer as Event Consumer
    participant WebSocket as WebSocket Server

    User->>Frontend: Update task (via UI or chat)
    Frontend->>TaskSvc: PUT /api/todos/{id}
    TaskSvc->>TaskSvc: Calculate diff (old vs new)
    TaskSvc->>TaskSvc: Update database
    TaskSvc->>Kafka: Publish task.updated event (with diff)
    TaskSvc-->>Frontend: 200 OK

    Kafka->>EventConsumer: Consume task.updated event
    EventConsumer->>WebSocket: Broadcast to user's clients
    WebSocket-->>Frontend: Real-time update
    Frontend-->>User: UI updates without refresh
```

