## Success Criteria

Phase V implementation is complete when:

- ✅ All 16 requirements implemented and tested
- ✅ All 8 database migrations deployed successfully
- ✅ All 5 services deployed with Dapr sidecars
- ✅ Kafka cluster operational with 3 topics
- ✅ Unit test coverage > 80%
- ✅ Integration tests passing (Kafka, Dapr)
- ✅ E2E tests passing (Playwright)
- ✅ Load tests: 1,000 concurrent users, P95 latency < 100ms
- ✅ CI/CD pipeline deploying to staging and production
- ✅ Monitoring dashboards operational
- ✅ Documentation complete (API docs, architecture diagrams)

